<title>JAPAN: Idemitsu unit wins long-term China gas oil deal.</title>
<headline>Idemitsu unit wins long-term China gas oil deal.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Idemitsu Kosan Co Ltd said on Friday that its Singapore-based subsidiary had reached an agreement on a long-term deal to sell gas oil to several Chinese companies.</p>
</text>
